Z||000000||KRMFiero||12-22-2001||11:26 AM||||Whats the Max mounting Depth for front and rear speakers?<P>Would RF 6x9's fit in front with adapter kit?<BR>would rf 4x6's fit in rear?<P>Kyle||||reg||1
Z||000001||sqoach||12-22-2001||01:13 PM||||I'm pretty sure the max depth for the 4x6s is 1.75" which leaves you a bit limited in your selection. I believe the RF 4x6s are 2" mounting depth. Not sure on the 6x9s up front. Seems like you'd need to fabricate something. There's plenty of room on the passenger side, but the driver side may cause a problem.<P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>                  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigsqoach2.gif">   <BR><B>86 SE V6 - daily driver</B>||||reg||1
